TASK-132.14 runtime harness: installs the API Explorer into an isolated profile, attaches chrome.debugger to an unselected (parked) tab from the worker and drives it with Input.* while the user types in the selected tab (posted key events), then drives the displayed tab from a page with the command palette open. Logs focus, menus, drag refusals and both pages' values. Temporary, never committed to Detour/.

    git apply docs/harness/task132.14-harness.patch && xcodegen generate && build
    DETOUR_DATA_DIR=DetourVerify13214-<n> DETOUR_VERIFY_DIR=$OUT DETOUR_API_EXPLORER=$PWD/TestExtensions/api-explorer .derived/.../Detour
    # "SHOOT <name> <windowNumber>" lines in $OUT/verify.log cue screencapture -l; ends with "done".

